/*
  VehicleConfigSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0300 · VehicleConfigSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleConfigSection` resolves (table "VehicleConfigSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first two groups are the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/vehicle-detail/VehicleConfigSection.tsx). The remainder
  back the native state envelope (no-value dash, empty sentence, freshness chip,
  connectivity banner, loading / error chrome) that the web leaf delegates to its parent
  page.
*/

